  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "While Fang Yuan flees during immortal ascension backlash, pursuers note that Gu Masters can preserve primeval essence with Gu such as fish bubble Gu, beggar moth, or grave yam Gu even after an aperture is shattered.",
        "chapters": [
          629
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "gu_fish_bubble_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan has already bought large numbers of beggar moths for that purpose.",
        "chapters": [
          632
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "These beggar moths are Gu worms used to store primeval essence. In the mortal world supply is limited, but with Hu Immortal blessed land Fang Yuan buys groups in treasure yellow heaven. Copies at rank five and rank four are few; rank three and rank two are numerous. He holds close to a thousand and brings almost all of them into northern plains.",
        "chapters": [
          632
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "storage-and-ranks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After that trip, the highest quantity among his remaining random mortal Gu is still beggar moths, almost a thousand, and they help him through the final moments of the journey by storing primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          650
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "storage-and-ranks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
